---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="支持與參與｜香港愛馬女士協會 HKALHL"
  description="加入香港愛馬女士協會成為會員或義工，一起支持社區健康與長者關懷。"
  active="join"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow light">
        <span></span> JOIN US
      </p>
      <h1>支持與參與</h1>
      <p>每一份時間與心意，都能讓關懷延續。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span></span> BE PART OF THE GOOD
          </p>
          <h2>與我們一起服務社區</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="join-grid">
        <article>
          <span class="join-icon">✧</span>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span></span> MEMBERSHIP
          </p>
          <h2>成為會員</h2>
          <p>
            與一群關心社區的愛馬人士同行，參與慈善項目、社區活動與協會交流。
          </p>
          <a
            class="button button-navy"
            href="mailto:ka20180801@gmail.com?subject=%E6%9C%83%E5%93%A1%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2"
          >
            電郵查詢申請 <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="join-icon">♡</span>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span></span> VOLUNTEER
          </p>
          <h2>加入義工</h2>
          <p>
            支援活動接待、義診登記分流、物資派發、長者陪伴或攝影紀錄，按你的時間與專長參與。
          </p>
          <a
            class="button button-navy"
            href="mailto:ka20180801@gmail.com?subject=%E7%BE%A9%E5%B7%A5%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2"
          >
            電郵查詢義工服務 <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="join join-compact">
    <div class="container join-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow light">
          <span></span> HAVE A QUESTION?
        </p>
        <h2>歡迎與我們聯絡</h2>
        <p>我們會透過電郵跟進你的查詢。</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-gold" href="mailto:ka20180801@gmail.com">
        聯絡我們 <span>↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
